and ResultSet stores rows returned by a SELECT query.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 67.2 393.4 cm .121569 .305882 .47451 rg BT/F2 12.5 Tf 0 3.5 TD (Software Requirements)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 67.2 373.4 cm 0 0 0 rg BT/F1 10.5 Tf 16 3.5 TD <7f>Tj ( )Tj ( )Tj (JDK 8 or above)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 67.2 355.4 cm 0 0 0 rg BT/F1 10.5 Tf 16 3.5 TD <7f>Tj ( )Tj ( )Tj (Eclipse or IntelliJ IDEA)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 67.2 337.4 cm 0 0 0 rg BT/F1 10.5 Tf 16 3.5 TD <7f>Tj ( )Tj ( )Tj (MySQL Server)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 67.2 319.4 cm 0 0 0 rg BT/F1 10.5 Tf 16 3.5 TD <7f>Tj ( )Tj ( )Tj (MySQL Connector/J driver)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 67.2 291.4 cm .121569 .305882 .47451 rg BT/F2 12.5 Tf 0 3.5 TD (Procedure / Algorithm)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 67.2 271.4 cm 0 0 0 rg BT/F1 10.5 Tf 16 3.5 TD (1.)Tj ( )Tj ( )Tj (Create a database named studentdb and a table named student.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 67.2 253.4 cm 0 0 0 rg BT/F1 10.5 Tf 16 3.5 TD (2.)Tj ( )Tj ( )Tj (Add the MySQL Connector/J JAR to the project classpath.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 67.2 235.4 cm 0 0 0 rg BT/F1 10.5 Tf 16 3.5 TD (3.)Tj ( )Tj ( )Tj (Create a Java class named JDBCInsertRetrieve.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 67.2 217.4 cm 0 0 0 rg BT/F1 10.5 Tf 16 3.5 TD (4.)Tj ( )Tj ( )Tj (Load the JDBC driver and establish a connection.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 67.2 199.4 cm 0 0 0 rg BT/F1 10.5 Tf 16 3.5 TD (5.)Tj ( )Tj ( )Tj (Execute an INSERT query and then a SELECT query.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 67.2 181.4 cm 0 0 0 rg BT/F1 10.5 Tf 16 3.5 TD (6.)Tj ( )Tj ( )Tj (Display the retrieved rows and close resources.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 67.2 153.4 cm .121569 .305882 .47451 rg BT/F2 12.5 Tf 0 3.5 TD (Program Code)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 67.2 132.4 cm .121569 .305882 .47451 rg BT/F4 10 Tf 0 3 TD (SQL Script)Tj ET Q Q q 0 0 612 792 re W n 1 1 1 rg 346.7 716.4 63.5 12 re f* 484.2 716.4 68.099979 12 re f* 59.7 41 60.2 11.5 re f* 123.9 41 64.49999 11.5 re f* Q
